SUMMARY:Bayanihan Closing Celebration & Concert
DESCRIPTION:Wrap up Filipino American History Month with an evening of mu
 sic\, storytelling\, dance\, art\, and cultural connection! Musical perf
 ormances by Kaylee Shimizu (The Voice) and Ragamuffs\, a fashion and art
  showcase by Raymund A. Maravilla\, a live talk story with Professor Rod
 erick Labrador and actor Dante Basco\, and a special dance performance b
 y Tekniqlingz. Explore the Sari-Sari Market by Art+Flea and join Jimmy T
 ablante for Malikhain na Pagpipinta\, a hands-on watercolor painting wor
 kshop.  https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/fahm-night  Sources: Capito
 l Modern https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/fahm-night
LOCATION:Capitol Modern: the Hawaiʻi State Art Museum
URL:https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/fahm-night
CATEGORIES:Capitol Modern
END:VEVENT
